# SG-CSF–SG-TSGRU for Sentiment Classification

A research implementation of the **Sentiment-Guided Contextual–Semantic Fusion (SG-CSF)** and **Sentiment-Guided Two-State GRU (SG-TSGRU)** model. The code combines RoBERTa contextual representations, token-aligned CBOW Word2Vec features, sentence-level VADER sentiment features, a sentiment-guided bidirectional GRU, attention pooling, and optional Sentiment-Preserving Semantic Augmentation (SP-SA).

> **Reproducibility note:** This repository implements the described architecture; it does not assert or guarantee any particular accuracy. Run experiments with the exact split, seeds, hardware, library versions, and data settings used in your study. Pilot sample caps are for code verification, not final paper results.

## Repository layout

```text
sg-csf-sg-tsgru/
